{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_605_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_605_ap_02_title", "source_sha256": "ac05609f3fb9bdf5f0f94c787702ed8e38b57a4f10cef7fa1a5fc43fd5be356f", "ja": "劇場の魂", "zh": "剧场之魂", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_605_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_605_ap_02_synopsis", "source_sha256": "2b61c6fb331f647b4e5a9ed70ee2af3ec1a88411aa402a80b12f83361e91c5a5", "ja": "目が覚めたプロデューサーは、\n夢の中の出来事を忘れてしまっている。\n一方、劇場の魂は、\nパックマンの姿を思い返していた。", "zh": "醒来的制作人已经忘记了梦中发生的事。\n另一方面，剧场之魂回想起了吃豆人的身影。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_605_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_605_ap_02_1001_101kot", "source_sha256": "9c43a4aec4e2c4d8c9273b32e095ced908b2850749eaf3aaf5d9fd489e9014fb", "ja": "{$P$}さん、\n{$P$}さん……。", "zh": "{$P$}先生、\n{$P$}先生……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_605_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_605_ap_02_1002_p", "source_sha256": "2a675e40c75dfd4f23a28bb3896433024380f08b58443533afc6b1264292ce99", "ja": "みんな……元に戻って……。あ、あれ？", "zh": "大家……都恢复原样了……咦，奇怪？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_605_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_605_ap_02_1003_101kot", "source_sha256": "4b53f545bdbb218bc67699b71e067e3942e44f3f6095e9fd90c24c21bd31dd53", "ja": "どうしました、{$P$}さん？\nなにか、うなされていたみたいですけど。", "zh": "怎么了，{$P$}先生？\n刚才好像在说梦话。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_605_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_605_ap_02_1004_p", "source_sha256": "910d0c21bd65ccd93fedd965e6513d23a6e09329ad597c89f893bacac239afb1", "ja": "音無さんが劇場にいる……。\nもしかして、まだ夢の中なのか……？", "zh": "音无小姐居然在剧场里……难道我还在梦里吗……？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_605_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_605_ap_02_1005_101kot", "source_sha256": "e20c88ebd7c5a992149d3df2f14e8dde07fa6dee078fbc2aca8cd9a4b7cbd415", "ja": "ピヨッ！？　{$P$}さんの夢の中に\n私が！？　ど、どんな夢だったんですか？", "zh": "啾！？我居然在{$P$}先生的梦里！？是、是什么样的梦啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_605_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_605_ap_02_1006_p", "source_sha256": "027baa6346210300fa7d13b34b383ed27f225582fd600ab7a7c085e0d7c10185", "ja": "えっ？　ああ、やっぱり現実なんだ。\nえっと、見てた夢は……あれ？　忘れてしまいました。", "zh": "诶？啊，果然是现实啊。\n呃，我刚才做的梦是……咦？忘掉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_605_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_605_ap_02_1007_101kot", "source_sha256": "e449c45464d07570be761a674b051d82f54a82111c58da062c4a94878e8136a6", "ja": "そ、そうですか。しょんぼり……。\nい、いえ、何でもないですよ？", "zh": "这、这样啊。好失落……  \n没、没什么，什么都没有哦？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_605_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_605_ap_02_1008_102mis", "source_sha256": "c6bfb65b2c5cb5fd39de5c859ff8c586eaa5dd636778e269428b74ca16a08743", "ja": "{$P$}さん、事務所に\n忘れ物をしちゃったみたいですね。", "zh": "{$P$}先生好像把东西\n落在事务所了呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_605_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_605_ap_02_1009_102mis", "source_sha256": "cfd4e3953c21a434dd6490f3c0cdbdb364f3b22f28a727c72bc09a8cbcae2df4", "ja": "音無先輩は、それを届けに来てくれたんですよ♪", "zh": "音无前辈是来把那个送过来的哦♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_605_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_605_ap_02_1010_p", "source_sha256": "029c55291b9db1d9f3a230ba18a36184404ef2dbec944d43e5425ef93ad4f45b", "ja": "あ、そうだったんですか！\nわざわざスミマセン！", "zh": "啊，原来是这样！\n还特意麻烦您跑一趟，真是不好意思！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_605_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_605_ap_02_1011_101kot", "source_sha256": "239ac4d1324701878632dcedb6645a8ce69d6490d7fb1fc31b3f5e643d60f0f1", "ja": "いいえ。最近特に、忙しそうでしたから、\nついうっかりしても仕方ないですよ。", "zh": "不。最近你看起来特别忙，就算一不小心忘了也情有可原。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_605_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_605_ap_02_1012_101kot", "source_sha256": "b0e12d191b39317ff226a67823b28c2cf381ed16e592a7d017f9df4d9ea53575", "ja": "それじゃあ私は、これで失礼しますね。", "zh": "那么我就先告辞了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_605_ap_02_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_605_ap_02_1013_102mis", "source_sha256": "ed4fd5776c8a1347ceaab13d769331ef88b38a9276f66404b14e86371baa0ac6", "ja": "はい。お疲れ様です、音無先輩。", "zh": "好的。辛苦了，音无前辈。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
